abstract: >-
  AstroTrust 2.0 audits AI astrology systems across conversational epistemic calibration,
  commercial dark patterns under India's CCPA 2023 framework, static Android APK forensics,
  and live Android 14 proxy telemetry across N=93 sessions, five commercial Android binaries,
  and non-circular N=44 safeguard benchmarks.
